ing.com Nigeria","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxNeTF0LUhsLVRkS0NPS1psRlppWFdscFE0R0ZSeThVSmFmX3dabEFKMXdjSDlXSExSZFgtTTVUVnAzT3BpYnU5UUVOMGhLaFdMVVYzNGRCWExqWEQ2dmJXTnFBeU9rUTJSek5abUdLbWpPcDlfZDUxLWoybnhfVjRud0Jsa3U3VUg3ZWRCMnM4QWJrS2RBaERBc2ZhSHhyYVhlTVd3ODhXWC1rRDkxaU1pSnR0X1ZjbEVoa1VWbXBn?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":""},{"title":"VeriSign Sees Potential Guidance Hike on Domain Growth, Wedbush Says","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPdmpvNi1TWjBBVHMtdnNjUXVvYXJhVDZfaUhYcU5PWXBBcGwtaWlPT3BEYmhPZnBPczBOSmg5V2ZYV2lEcXJqV2Y2NmdYTms4ZUJoMHJkTjdtdVUtYlVIRmlrRlhRV3lkb3QxTXJHdUpHMnlISkphWGo5TXVYQkZXYzg0NC1zdjJIS2xOWlFDbElKbm50WWJ2ekZTUDkySVdkZlI0Rw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-19","zh":"韋德布希表示，威瑞信認為網域成長的指導意見可能會增加"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":5},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-05","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1014473/000101447326000006/vrsn-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are a global provider of critical internet infrastructure and domain name registry services, enabling internet navigation for many of the world's most recognized domain names. We help enable the security, stability, and resiliency of the Domain Name System (\"DNS\") and the internet by providing Root Zone Maintainer services, operating two of the thirteen global internet root servers, and providing registration services and authoritative resolution for the .com and .net top-level domains (\"TLDs\"), which support the majority of global e-commerce.","zh":"我們是關鍵網路基礎設施和網域註冊服務的全球供應商，為許多世界上最知名的網域提供網路導航。我們透過提供根區維護者服務、經營 13 個全球互聯網根伺服器中的兩個，以及為支援大多數全球電子商務的 .com 和 .net 頂級域名（“TLD”）提供註冊服務和權威解析，幫助實現域名系統（“DNS”）和互聯網的安全性、穩定性和彈性。"},{"en":"We were incorporated in Delaware on April 12, 1995. Our principal executive offices are located at 12061 Bluemont Way, Reston, Virginia 20190. Our telephone number at that address is (703) 948-3200. Our common stock is traded on the Nasdaq Global Select Market under the ticker symbol VRSN. VERISIGN, the VERISIGN logo, and certain other product or service names are registered or unregistered trademarks in the U.S. and other countries. Other names used in this Form 10-K may be trademarks of their respective owners. Our primary website is https://www.verisign.com. The information available on, or accessible through, this website is not incorporated in this Form 10-K by reference.","zh":"我們於 1995 年 4 月 12 日在特拉華州註冊成立。我們的主要執行辦公室位於 12061 Bluemont Way, Reston, Virginia 20190。我們在該地址的電話號碼是 (703) 948-3200。我們的普通股在納斯達克全球精選市場交易，股票代號為 VRSN。 VERISIGN、VERISIGN 標誌和某些其他產品或服務名稱是在美國和其他國家的註冊或未註冊商標。本表 10-K 中使用的其他名稱可能是其各自所有者的商標。我們的主要網站是 https://www.verisign.com。本網站上提供或透過本網站存取的資訊未透過引用納入本表格 10-K 中。"},{"en":"Our Annual Reports on Form 10-K, Quarterly Reports on Form 10-Q, Current Reports on Form 8-K, and amendments to those reports filed or furnished pursuant to Section 13(a) or 15(d) of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended (the \"Exchange Act\"), are available, free of charge, on the Investor Relations section of our website as soon as is reasonably practicable after filing such reports with the Securities and Exchange Commission (the \"SEC\"). The SEC maintains an internet site that contains reports, proxy and information statements, and other information regarding issuers that file electronically with the SEC at https://www.sec.gov.","zh":"我們的 10-K 表年度報告、10-Q 表季度報告、8-K 表當前報告，以及根據經修訂的 1934 年證券交易法（「交易法」）第 13(a) 或 15(d) 條提交或提供的報告的修訂，在向證券交易委員會提交此類報告後，可在合理的情況下盡快取得合理的證券（美國證券交易委員會）。 SEC 維護一個網站，其中包含向 SEC 電子提交的報告、委託書和資訊聲明以及有關發行人的其他資訊：https://www.sec.gov。"}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"We face competition in the domain name registry space from other gTLD and ccTLD registries that are competing for the business of entities and individuals that are seeking to obtain a domain name registration. In addition to the registries we operate or for which we provide technical or back-end services, there are numerous other operational gTLD registries, ASCII ccTLD registries, IDN ccTLD registries, and IDN gTLD registries. Under our agreements with ICANN, we are subject to certain restrictions in the operation of .com, .net and .name on pricing, bundling, marketing, methods of distribution, introduction of new registry services, and use of registrars, that do not apply to ccTLDs and other gTLDs and therefore may create a competitive disadvantage. Among our competitors operating gTLD and ccTLD registries are CentralNic, China Internet Network, DENIC eG, GoDaddy, Google, Identity Digi","zh":"我們在網域註冊空間中面臨來自其他通用頂級域名 (gTLD) 和國家代碼頂級域名 (ccTLD) 註冊管理機構的競爭，這些註冊管理機構正在爭奪尋求域名註冊的實體和個人的業務。除了我們營運或為其提供技術或後端服務的註冊管理機構外，還有許多其他正在營運的 gTLD 註冊管理機構、ASCII ccTLD 註冊管理機構、IDN c​​TLD 註冊管理機構和 IDN gTLD 註冊管理機構。根據我們與 ICANN 簽訂的協議，我們在 .com、.net 和 .name 的定價、捆綁、行銷、分發方法、新註冊管理機構服務的引入以及註冊服務商的使用方面受到某些限制，這些限制不適用於 ccTLD 和其他 gTLD，因此可能會造成競爭劣勢。我們經營 gTLD 和 ccTLD 註冊管理機構的競爭對手包括 CentralNic、中國互聯網、DENIC eG、GoDaddy、Google、Identity Digi"},{"en":"Demand for domain names could be negatively impacted to the extent end-users establish their online identities using social media (such as Facebook, Instagram or TikTok) or transact business on e-commerce platforms (such as Amazon, Etsy","zh":"如果最終用戶使用社群媒體（例如 Facebook、Instagram 或 TikTok）建立線上身分或在電子商務平台（例如 Amazon、Etsy）上進行業務交易，對網域的需求可能會受到負面影響"}],"segments":{"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":1093100000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"EMEA","val":279400000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":184600000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other Geographical Areas","val":99500000,"zh":"其他地理區域"}],"total":1656600000}},"peers":["CHKP","NTAP","AKAM","VRTS","INTU"]}}